WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.656
Pinocchio ran to the ocean.

2
00:00:02.657 --> 00:00:06.898
Because he had worked at the orphanage, he was very strong.

3
00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:09.387
He swam through the waves easily.

4
00:00:09.388 --> 00:00:14.160
He swam so fast, he was able to swim with some dolphins.

5
00:00:14.161 --> 00:00:17.318
"Hello, dolphins!" Pinocchio called.

6
00:00:17.319 --> 00:00:19.861
"I am looking for a large whale.

7
00:00:19.862 --> 00:00:22.255
Do you know where I can find it?"

8
00:00:22.256 --> 00:00:27.215
"Yeah, yeah, yeah," the dolphins said.

9
00:00:27.216 --> 00:00:29.713
They swam a big circle around him.

10
00:00:29.714 --> 00:00:33.432
One dolphin came below Pinocchio to help him swim deeper.

11
00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:36.340
The dolphins swam off in a new direction.

12
00:00:36.341 --> 00:00:38.510
Pinocchio held on tightly.

13
00:00:38.511 --> 00:00:43.772
"Whee, this is fun!" he shouted through the bubbles.

14
00:00:43.773 --> 00:00:46.391
The dolphins dove deeper and deeper.

15
00:00:46.392 --> 00:00:49.146
Pinocchio could see something very big ahead.

16
00:00:49.147 --> 00:00:51.403
It looked like a big blue house.

17
00:00:51.404 --> 00:00:52.780
It was the whale!

18
00:00:52.781 --> 00:00:55.602
The dolphins swam near the whale.

19
00:00:55.603 --> 00:00:58.967
"Hi, big whale!" they called.

20
00:00:58.968 --> 00:01:02.728
"Hello," the whale called back.

21
00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:09.000
When the whale opened its mouth to say hello, Pinocchio jumped inside.

22
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:11.279
"It’s so dark in here!"

23
00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.493
Pinocchio said, walking carefully along the whale’s teeth.

24
00:01:15.494 --> 00:01:17.962
"It’s nice and warm though."

25
00:01:17.963 --> 00:01:26.767
He walked deep into the whale’s throat.

26
00:01:26.768 --> 00:01:32.307
As Pinocchio got closer to the whale’s stomach, he noticed a bad smell.

27
00:01:32.308 --> 00:01:37.273
"Oh, that’s gross!" he said. "What smells so bad?"

28
00:01:37.274 --> 00:01:39.165
"I do," said a voice.

29
00:01:39.166 --> 00:01:42.271
"Father?" Pinocchio called.

30
00:01:42.272 --> 00:01:46.544
"Pinocchio, is that you?" Geppetto called back.

31
00:01:46.545 --> 00:01:51.249
Even though they were inside a smelly fish, they had never been happier.

32
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:55.952
They ran across the whale’s stomach and held each other.

33
00:01:55.953 --> 00:01:59.019
"Oh, Father. You are very thin.

34
00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.397
I am sorry it took me so long to find you.

35
00:02:02.398 --> 00:02:05.675
Please forgive me," Pinocchio said.

36
00:02:05.676 --> 00:02:08.885
"Pinocchio, how did you find me?

37
00:02:08.886 --> 00:02:10.829
I had given up hope.

38
00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:15.150
I thought you were lost too," said Geppetto.

39
00:02:15.151 --> 00:02:19.745
They both had many questions to ask and even more stories to tell.

40
00:02:19.746 --> 00:02:22.196
But the whale was swimming deeper.

41
00:02:22.197 --> 00:02:26.954
"Father, we must get out of this whale quickly," said Pinocchio.

42
00:02:26.955 --> 00:02:30.291
"It is no use," said

43
00:02:30.292 --> 00:02:35.981
Geppetto. "I have tried many times, but the whale will not open its

44
00:02:35.982 --> 00:02:38.691
mouth." Pinocchio remembered the story of

45
00:02:38.692 --> 00:02:41.009
Jonah. The whale had spit Jonah

46
00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:43.752
out. How could Pinocchio make this whale spit them

47
00:02:43.753 --> 00:02:45.724
out? Suddenly, he had an

48
00:02:45.725 --> 00:02:49.242
idea. "Father, climb with me up to the whale’s

49
00:02:49.243 --> 00:02:51.744
mouth. Here, I will help

50
00:02:51.745 --> 00:02:55.895
you." Together, the two climbed up and sat on the whale’s

51
00:02:55.896 --> 00:03:00.827
teeth. "Can you reach up and tickle the top of the whale’s mouth?" Pinocchio

52
00:03:00.828 --> 00:03:04.374
asked. "I can try," answered

53
00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:07.336
Geppetto. He stood very tall and tickled the

54
00:03:07.337 --> 00:03:09.780
whale. The whale started to swim up very

55
00:03:09.781 --> 00:03:12.413
quickly. Its tongue started to

56
00:03:12.414 --> 00:03:20.057
jump. "Ahh­-ahh-­choo!" the whale said, and it sneezed them onto the

57
00:03:20.058 --> 00:03:24.467
sand. "Hooray, we made it!" cheered

58
00:03:24.468 --> 00:03:28.736
Pinocchio. "Oh, you are so smart, son!" said

59
00:03:28.737 --> 00:03:32.247
Geppetto. "How did you know to tickle the

60
00:03:32.248 --> 00:03:38.495
whale?" "I got the idea from something I learned at a school," Pinocchio said,

61
00:03:38.496 --> 00:03:42.725
smiling. Just then, the whale began to slide up onto the sand and

62
00:03:42.726 --> 00:03:45.484
speak. Its voice was soft and

63
00:03:45.485 --> 00:03:49.013
pretty. "Well done, Pinocchio," it

64
00:03:49.014 --> 00:03:52.738
said. "You have proven yourself to be a good

65
00:03:52.739 --> 00:03:55.197
boy. You have honored your

66
00:03:55.198 --> 00:03:58.682
father. You have been obedient and

67
00:03:58.683 --> 00:04:02.218
generous. You have risked your life to save

68
00:04:02.219 --> 00:04:04.148
him." Suddenly, the whale

69
00:04:04.149 --> 00:04:06.990
vanished. In its place stood the Blue

70
00:04:06.991 --> 00:04:12.940
Fairy. "Blue Fairy! You were the whale?" Pinocchio asked, very

71
00:04:12.941 --> 00:04:19.100
surprised. "Yes. I kept Geppetto safe until you learned to be a good

72
00:04:19.101 --> 00:04:23.580
boy. Farewell, gentlemen. I wish you a happy life

73
00:04:23.581 --> 00:04:29.065
together," she said, and the Blue Fairy flew

74
00:04:29.066 --> 00:04:31.432
away. Pinocchio and Geppetto waved

75
00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:34.463
good-bye. As Pinocchio waved, he looked at his

76
00:04:34.464 --> 00:04:37.692
hand. It was the hand of a real

77
00:04:37.693 --> 00:04:41.897
boy. "Ah! I’m a real boy! Father,

78
00:04:41.898 --> 00:04:44.887
look! I’m really real!" he

79
00:04:44.888 --> 00:04:57.782
cried. Father and son laughed and hugged and danced all the way

80
00:04:57.783 --> 00:05:37.364
home.

